Subject: [PATCH] Improve Purpur AFK system

Frontier 26.4: register optional AFK command in native Brigadier, execute AFK cooldown checks only on server thread, keep /afk toggle from clearing existing AFK state, protect malformed title configuration and ensure first use cannot be blocked by arbitrary nanoTime origin. Original Leaf author Dreeam. Runtime validation pending.
